WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
Episode 23

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
Finally <i>!
</i>Arrived at the Magellanic Cloud,
the Storm is Strong <i>!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
( Air date: Mar 09, 1975 )

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:21.230
Saraba Chikyuu yo

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:26.100
Tabidatsu fune wa...

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:35.240
...uchuu senkan Yamato

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:40.530
Space Battleship

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:40.530
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:43.580
Uchuu no kanata Iscandar he...

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.280
...unmei seoi...

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.150
...ima tobitatsu

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:51.610
Kanarazu koko he...

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.980
...kaette kuru to

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.850
Te wo furu hito ni...

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:03.450
...egao de kotae

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.080
Ginga wo hanare...

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.630
...Iscandar he...

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.800
...harubaru nozomu

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:15.430
Uchuu senkan Yamato

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:04.230
As the Chief Engineer of the Yamato,
I guarantee that it's not malfunctioning.

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:08.350
But it's not showing
the Yamato's course.

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:10.230
She's right.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:16.400
It's not showing the Yamato's bearing,
but pointing at the destination.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:21.330
Who...who could be
manipulating it from space ?

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.700
Could it be Gamilus ?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.110
Maybe from Iscandar.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.210
Aihara, haven't you found
the source of the signal ?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.300
In any case, it's coming from the
Magellanic Cloud that we're heading for.

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.280
Hey Aihara, that's
an audio signal.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.350
...Starsha...
Starsha of Iscandar.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.450
I knew it.
It's from Starsha.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:03:00.220
No doubt about it. The signal's
coming from point 1836M.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.170
That's where the planet
Iscandar should be.

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:09.370
I'm Starsha of Iscandar.
Yamato crew, can you hear me ?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:14.380
You've come to your destination,
the planet Iscandar.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:19.920
Iscandar is the 8th planet that orbits
the sun in the Magellanic Cloud.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.530
It's located 0.8 light
years from your position.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:28.450
Please follow
our homing signal.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:29.550
Hey, Shima...

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:30.530
Kodai...

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:32.680
Way to go.

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:33.540
Great.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:55.640
In 2199, Earth was attacked by the mysterious
planet Gamilus with their Meteor Bombs.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:59.640
{SONO}Mankind was facing extinction due to the
radioactive contamination in one year.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:02.230
The planet Iscandar is located
148,000 light years away...

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:05.600
...claims to have a radioactive poison
purifier it is willing to give to Earth.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.230
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:13.180
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to obtain
the radioactive poison purifier.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.280
198 days have passed,
since it departed Earth.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:19.830
Overcoming unimaginable ordeals...

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:24.510
...the Yamato is approaching
Iscandar in the Magellanic Cloud.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.120
Alright, I'm gonna
set the timer.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:39.970
Good.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:48.780
Ouch...

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:51.130
You're mean.

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.230
Oh, c'mon.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:55.830
Kids can make fun of the story
about dad and mom's youth.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.130
That's true.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.230
Well, I'm busy, so...
Kodai, thanks anyway.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.330
Okay.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.230
Bye.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.830
Girls are precocious.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:09.830
Story about dad
and mom's youth...

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.370
Dad and mom...
Meaning who ?

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.250
It's great to be young.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.710
Doc, you were
watching all along ?

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.680
{SHIKASHI}But don't take
it so easy.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:28.470
{SHIKASHI}People used to say,
"Assume 99 is halfway to 100."

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:32.580
{TATOEBA}Meaning, if you're taking a trip
of 100 km, when you pass 99 km...

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.180
{YOYAKU}...consider it the halfway mark.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:40.600
{IMA}Don't you think it applies to us ?
No one on this ship has seen Iscandar yet.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:45.440
{SOKO}We don't know what's there or what's
gonna happen, until the trip is over.

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:50.590
Thank you for
your advice, Doctor.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.640
What happened ?

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:01.480
Sorry to bother you, Communications Chief.
It's about the signal from Iscandar.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:02.900
It's lost ?

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:10.630
Switch control to the 1st bridge.
I'll report to the Sub-Captain.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.680
Listen. This is
the planet Iscandar.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.480
The estimated distance from the sun
at the center is 300 million km.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.990
It's the 8th planet, and the
size is about 1.3 times of Earth.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:22.810
I got that already.
What're you trying to say ?

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:26.940
Are you telling us that
the map was wrong ?

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:27.590
Yes.

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.970
Shima, we lost the signal
from Iscandar.  Make it short.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:35.280
There appear to be
two 8th planets.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.580
What ?!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.170
Ohta, put the radar
screen on the large panel.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:42.780
Aye, sir.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:51.680
I see.
There are two.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:56.590
They're twin planets.
Iscandar seems to be one of them.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.030
Twin planets ?

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.730
So, there are two
planets like this...

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.780
...and they rotate around each
other and orbit the sun ?

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:04.910
Right.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.670
It'll be alright.
It's better than one.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:11.550
It disappeared.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.150
The signal was jammed.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.270
The guidance beacon must've been lost because of the same reason.

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:17.310
Missiles from 12 o'clock.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.680
There're about 60,
distance 200 km.

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:24.130
12 o'clock ?  Hey Ohta,
that's where Iscandar is.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.900
Anyway, we're under attack.
Kodai, give us your orders.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.920
Open the forward main cannons.
Prepare to intercept.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.700
Prepare to intercept.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.430
Bearing SP22 RP40.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:38.910
Open the target scope.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.320
Turret 1, standing-by.

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.320
Turret 2, standing-by.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:47.030
The enemy missiles have
split up into four groups.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:50.070
They may attack the Yamato
from right, left, top and bottom.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.470
Open all guns.
Noncombatants, take cover.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:07:59.480
I'm fine here.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.550
The missiles will hit
in 1 minute 5 seconds.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.440
Sub-cannon 2, ready.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.350
Anti-air battery 4, ready.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.820
45 seconds.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.090
All guns, fire !

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:57.910
The port sub-cannon was hit.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.560
Main cannon 2 took a hit.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.550
Oh, no !  Chief Engine Operator
Tokugawa, please stop the engines !

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.170
Stop all engines !
Stop all engines !

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:06.030
Stop ?

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:08.020
I'm the Sub-Captain.
Don't give orders without me.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.250
I'll apologize later.
Just look at this.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.950
{KOUKAI}Every navigation gauge has gone crazy.
It's dangerous to move.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:17.280
{TEKI}The objective of this enemy
attack was to blind and deafen us.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:33.230
So intercepting the missiles with all of
our guns resulted in helping the enemy...

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:36.930
...who was trying scatter
the jammer, after all.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.460
That's right.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.230
And who is that enemy ?

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.710
Say it !

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.550
Do you want me to say who
you think our enemy is ?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:49.050
Iscandar is also our enemy.
That's what you're thinking, isn't it ?

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.230
It's not.

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.340
I don't know.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:54.290
Kato.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.250
Yes ?

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.230
Move out.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:59.480
There should be pieces of those missiles.
We'll analyze them, so go get some.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:02.730
It's impossible, Chief Combat Commander,
the gauges are malfunctioning.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.130
You idiot !
Get some, no matter what !

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.150
It's Gamilus.

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:35.700
Mr. Sanada, I didn't hear you well.
Could you tell me one more time ?

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.240
It's a Gamilus missile.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.340
Shima...

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:46.830
Did we come to Gamilus,
instead of Iscandar ?

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:54.160
We never knew where
the planet Gamilus was.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.600
What they call Iscandar might
actually be the planet Gamilus.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:05.140
It is indeed
the planet Gamilus.

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:54.800
You have a call from
Starsha of Iscandar via the hotline.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.230
It's been a while, Starsha.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:03.030
I don't remember how many years
it's been since I last heard your voice.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.740
{KONO}I thought this
hotline was dead.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:10.830
I didn't know
it was functional.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:17.660
Lord Desler, why are you jamming
the signals around Iscandar ?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.750
A complaint, Starsha ?

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.030
Yes.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:26.230
Complain, complain. You only call
me when you have a complaint.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:31.260
{TAMA}Can't I hear kind words from you ?
Our planets are twins.

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:36.570
Even so, you're good
at harming people.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.230
You've misunderstood, Starsha.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:43.770
We're just more aggressive
about pursuing our happiness.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:49.090
Whatever the reason, you've invaded
every corner of the galaxy, haven't you ?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:54.640
I want you to understand.
Both of our planets are dying.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:58.640
That's why I'm seeking
a planet to migrate to.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.580
What's wrong with that ?

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:07.340
You've found Earth, and you're
killing the Earthlings to migrate there.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.280
Why not ?
They're primitive.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:15.290
Even if their science is inferior, they're
humans, and they have the right to live.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.830
The people of Gamilus have
the right to live, also.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.260
Even if you kill others ?

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:27.850
Right.  We won't die, unlike your people,
who accepted your planet's fate and died.

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.680
Further talk is meaningless.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:36.800
As long as the Yamato
comes to Iscandar itself...

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.980
...I will give them the 
device that cleanses radiation.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:45.200
Go ahead. As long as I live,
I won't let the Yamato reach your planet.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:47.200
Bye, Starsha.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:07.570
Long live Lord Desler !

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:12.130
Long live Lord Desler !

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:16.850
Long live Lord Desler !

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:23.460
Everyone, the Yamato has arrived.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.160
I'll command all forces.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.350
We'll use the planet Gamilus
to fight against it.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.580
I'll explain my plan.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.780
As you know, this is
our planet, Gamilus.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:45.170
It's a planet 16,000 km diameter,
which is Iscandar's twin.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.530
{KORE}This is the section view.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:51.380
{GAMILUS}The surface of the inner sphere
is mainly continents and oceans.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.470
{TAIRIKU}There are mountains
on the continents.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:15:00.790
{KONO}The pillars hold up the 10km thick outer
shell, which covers the inner sphere.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:05.030
{KONO}The space between the outer shell and the
inner sphere used to be under the ground...

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:07.830
{NAGANEN}...but it was weathered over
a long period of time...

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:10.950
{NAGANEN}...and it's a unique characteristic
of our planet, Gamilus.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:16.480
{SHOKUN}As you know, the expected lifespan
of our planet is very short.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:22.030
{KONO}As a matter of fact, the underground
materials are constantly sulfurizing.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:26.400
{KAZAN}Volcanoes emit sulfurous acid gas,
and a sulfurous acid lava flows out.

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:33.230
{SORE}It changed the ocean of Gamilus
to a strong sulfurous acid...

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:36.580
{RYUUKA}...and hydrogen sulfide winds
cause sulfuric acid rain.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.030
{WATASHI}I'm going to sink the
Yamato into this cursed sea.

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:46.060
{UCYUU}Don't you think it's the most suitable
graveyard for the space battleship Yamato ?

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:55.980
{SUDENI}The Yamato's already been captured by
super magnetic ferrite just outside the planet.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:02.970
{KONO}This super magnetic ferrite not only cuts off
all communications and disables sensors...

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:06.230
{GAMILUS}...but once the magnetic force
generators on Gamilus are activated...

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:11.500
{GAMILUS}...it will draw in the Yamato, just like
a magnet attracts iron-rich sand.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:15.160
{ATO}We will then drag it into the ocean
through the opening on the surface...

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.780
{KIATSU}...and generate low pressure with the
atmospheric controllers to cause a storm.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:23.880
{KUWAETE}In addition, the coastal
guns will add a bombardment.

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:31.150
{YAMATO}The Yamato will be like a cockroach that
has fallen into a beaker of sulfuric acid.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.830
Kodai, there's a
message from Starsha.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.420
What ?

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:04.800
This is Starsha of Iscandar.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.810
{YOUYAKU}I can finally
transmit a message.

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:09.730
Gamilus is interfering
with our communications.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.480
{MOU}I can't guide you anymore.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:17.780
{JIBUN}Defeat Gamilus yourself, and come to
Iscandar, as you have done already.

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:24.230
{SOKO}As you may have learned,
our planets are twins.

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.610
{SOKO}One is Gamilus;
the other is Iscandar...

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.300
Kodai...

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.540
So that's it.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:44.820
Shima, your navigation was right.
I apologize for what I did earlier.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.000
I'm sorry.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.090
Kodai...

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:52.800
Just a little further, isn't it ?

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:12.450
There's no path to Iscandar,
unless we defeat Gamilus.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.760
Do it, Kodai.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.560
Aye, sir.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.230
W...what ?

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.230
What happened ?

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:37.060
A strong magnetic force is acting on
the Yamato, and is dragging the ship in !

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:40.640
Dammit !  It's because of the
particles surrounding the ship.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:42.640
Reverse thrust !
Reverse thrust !  Hurry !

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:47.970
All hands, man
your battlestations !

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.130
It's no good.
I can't regain control, Kodai.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:39.120
I'm gonna be broken...

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:08.950
Ouch.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.160
That was a rough
invitation, Mr. Gamilus.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:18.540
There's an ocean beneath the surface.
Strange planet, isn't it ?

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:22.520
Kodai, what're
we going to do ?

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:25.130
We need to know their next move.
We'd better watch and wait.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:27.310
Analyzer, investigate the environment.

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:32.020
Just a second, Kodai.  Mr. Sanada
will assemble it right away.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:34.170
It's useless at
a time like this.

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.090
Rain clouds are forming.
A storm's coming.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.090
Repairs complete. Now, analyze
the seawater and air, Analyzer.

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:11.570
A ship has to be on the ocean after all.
It feels great. Don't you think so ?

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.010
Analysis is complete.
I'm reporting.

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:16.680
The air is
sulfuric acid gas...

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:19.700
...rain is diluted sulfuric acid and the
seawater is sulfuric acid of pH scale 3.

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:22.590
Hurry !
The Yamato will corrode !

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:24.660
Engines full !
Vertical take off !

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:40.740
Kodai, the third
bridge fell off.

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:44.900
Bombs from above.

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:47.190
Activate aft thrusters.

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:03.640
The Yamato is cornered.

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:08.340
The strong sulfuric acid rainstorm
and waves will corrode any metal.

00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:11.170
{YAMATO}Bombs will seal the
Yamato's escape route.

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:15.790
{GEKICHIN} Yamato, will you be sunk and
melt in the sea of sulfuric acid ?

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:21.620
Kodai, what's wrong ?
Earth is waiting for you.

